{
 "total": 65.289,
 "scenes": [
  {
   "v": "hook_puppy",
   "start": 0.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Fourteen thousand years ago, people nursed a very sick puppy for weeks.",
     "start": 0.6,
     "end": 4.526
    },
    {
     "text": "Its teeth tell the story.",
     "start": 4.846,
     "end": 6.226
    }
   ],
   "end": 6.596
  },
  {
   "v": "hook_q",
   "start": 6.596,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "So, did cavemen have pets?",
     "start": 6.896,
     "end": 8.449
    }
   ],
   "end": 8.819
  },
  {
   "v": "meet_moss",
   "start": 8.819,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Meet Moss. He wants a puppy.",
     "start": 9.119,
     "end": 10.757
    }
   ],
   "end": 11.127
  },
  {
   "v": "bonn_grave",
   "start": 11.127,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Surprise one: in Germany, it was buried with a man and a woman.",
     "start": 11.427,
     "end": 15.203
    }
   ],
   "end": 15.573
  },
  {
   "v": "distemper",
   "start": 15.573,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "It had a nasty illness called distemper.",
     "start": 15.873,
     "end": 18.061
    },
    {
     "text": "Without care, it would die within three weeks.",
     "start": 18.381,
     "end": 20.607
    }
   ],
   "end": 20.977
  },
  {
   "v": "nursed",
   "start": 20.977,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "But it lived about eight more weeks.",
     "start": 21.277,
     "end": 22.956
    },
    {
     "text": "Experts think someone kept it warm, fed and clean.",
     "start": 23.276,
     "end": 26.205
    }
   ],
   "end": 26.575
  },
  {
   "v": "loved",
   "start": 26.575,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "A sick puppy can't work.",
     "start": 26.875,
     "end": 28.3
    },
    {
     "text": "So it was probably loved.",
     "start": 28.62,
     "end": 30.012
    }
   ],
   "end": 30.382
  },
  {
   "v": "oldest_friends",
   "start": 30.382,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Surprise two: dogs are our oldest animal friends.",
     "start": 30.682,
     "end": 33.849
    },
    {
     "text": "They've lived with us at least fifteen thousand years.",
     "start": 34.169,
     "end": 36.872
    }
   ],
   "end": 37.242
  },
  {
   "v": "fox",
   "start": 37.242,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Surprise three: a fox!",
     "start": 37.542,
     "end": 39.052
    },
    {
     "text": "In Jordan, about sixteen thousand years ago, a fox was buried with a person.",
     "start": 39.372,
     "end": 43.993
    },
    {
     "text": "A pet? Maybe. Scientists aren't sure.",
     "start": 44.313,
     "end": 46.412
    }
   ],
   "end": 46.782
  },
  {
   "v": "hand_puppy",
   "start": 46.782,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Surprise four: in Israel, about twelve thousand years ago, a woman was buried with her hand on a puppy.",
     "start": 47.082,
     "end": 53.124
    }
   ],
   "end": 53.494
  },
  {
   "v": "ending",
   "start": 53.494,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "So yes, cavemen had furry friends.",
     "start": 53.794,
     "end": 55.827
    },
    {
     "text": "Some were cared for like family.",
     "start": 56.147,
     "end": 57.692
    }
   ],
   "end": 58.062
  },
  {
   "v": "moss_puppy",
   "start": 58.062,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "And Moss? His puppy just stole his dinner.",
     "start": 58.362,
     "end": 60.565
    }
   ],
   "end": 60.935
  },
  {
   "v": "follow",
   "start": 60.935,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Follow for more Stone Age Stories.",
     "start": 61.235,
     "end": 63.119
    }
   ],
   "end": 65.289
  }
 ]
}